# ═══ Command-center .gitignore — durability model (Mission 4.1): GitHub + recovery key → complete workspace ═══
# Business documents, registers, sources, archives, the Business Operating Model (core AND overlay) and Deputy's durable
# state export ARE versioned. Only genuinely non-repository artifacts are ignored. Access credentials never enter Git in
# plaintext — mechanically enforced by .claude/policy/sensitive_scan.py (RESTRICTED = blocked), not by this file.

# ── regenerated runtime (bootstrap.py rebuilds from .claude/runtime/requirements.lock) ──
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── ephemeral Deputy runtime state (the durable export is .claude/state/durable/, versioned) ──
.claude/state/*
!.claude/state/durable/
!.claude/state/durable/**
.claude/audit/

# ── regenerated artifacts (deterministic; bootstrap rebuilds and re-certifies) ──
.claude/business/*.json
.claude/business/Business-model.md
.claude/integrations/*.json

# ── plaintext / decrypted credential material (never; recovery goes through .secure/credentials.gpg) ──
.secure/*.plain*
.secure/*.dec*
.secure/*.tmp
.secure/*.tar
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── machine garbage, locks, temp ──
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
~$*
*.lock
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
